eatment. Minor complaint of occasional urinary urgency.\nO: BP 113/79, HR 73, RR 19, Temp 98.3F, Wt 134 lb. Neurological exam stable. EDSS score 7.\nA: Multiple sclerosis - fair control\nP: Continue current treatment with fingolimod 0.5 mg. Discussed bladder management techniques. Routine follow-up in 3-6 months.\n\n--- 08/01/2023 Office Visit ---\nS: Patient presents for follow-up on Multiple sclerosis. Reports improvement in overall energy levels and reduced frequency of relapses.\nO: BP 118/69, HR 71, RR 17, Temp 98.6F, Wt 125 lb. Neurological exam shows stable findings. EDSS score 7.\nA: Multiple sclerosis - improv"
